# Steam shot 3: level 5 solo — the natural generation-4 field (reflective,
# teleporting, invisible specials in the mix) with a few placed close.
size 1920 1080
seed 14
sim 1200
game 4
camera fixed
ship 0 0 -25
hold w 100
hold space 300
asteroid 350 800 r=90 v=-30,-40
asteroid -750 350 reflective r=100 v=25,-10
